      "short_effect": "Held: Allows Sceptile to Mega Evolve into Mega Sceptile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ジュカインに　もたせておくとたたかいのとき　メガシンカが　できるふしぎな　メガストーンの　いっしゅ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "나무킹에게 지니게 하면 배틀할 때 메가진화할 수 있는 신비한 메가스톤의 일종.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une variété de Méga-Gemme. Tenue par un Jungko, elle lui permet de méga-évoluer durant un combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Einer der mysteriösen Mega-Steine. Wird er von einem Gewaldro getragen, kann es im Kampf eine Mega-Entwicklung durchführen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorito obtenido en el Monte Cenizo. Presenta unos peculiares grabados e irradia una luz con los siete colores del arcoíris.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una delle misteriose Megapietre. Data a Sceptile, gli permette di megaevolversi durante la lotta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of a variety of mysterious Mega Stones. Have Sceptile hold it, and this stone will enable it to Mega Evolve during battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ジュカインに　持たせておくと戦いのとき　メガシンカが　できる不思議な　メガストーンの　一種。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "omega-ruby-alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/16/"
